{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Tower Defense Game In Reverse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the attacker for once. Build your army and guide your Battering Ram along the path, through the maze of obstacles and fortifications to the enemy castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/Overview_Gif.gif?t=1740400150\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Protect the Ram at all costs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Battering Ram is your most important unit. Stay close and keep moving it forward. Guide it through the enemy castle and bring down every gate and obstacle in your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/ProtectRam.gif?t=1740400150\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Call the banners. Build your army. It's time for a siege.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build out your army with the rewards of your attacks. Choose from archers, swordsman and more to defend your Battering Ram and claim another castle for your Kingdom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the banner system to command your soldiers on the field of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/ControllingUnits.gif?t=1740400150\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Army Dead? Step into action and become the King you were born to be.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your bow to pick off approaching enemies from a distance, swing your sword to take out groups of enemies in one fell swoop and set explosive traps for unsuspecting enemies to fall right into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/ArmyDead.gif?t=1740400150\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3021860?t=1740400150","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3021860?t=1740400150","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/2904395e768c9de1dfe312bcd09c923d1ce2e1c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740400150","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/2904395e768c9de1dfe312bcd09c923d1ce2e1c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740400150","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Tower Defense Game In Reverse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the attacker for once. Build your army and guide your Battering Ram along the path, through the maze of obstacles and fortifications to the enemy castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/Overview_Gif.gif?t=1740400150\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Protect the Ram at all costs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Battering Ram is your most important unit. Stay close and keep moving it forward. Guide it through the enemy castle and bring down every gate and obstacle in your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021860/extras/ProtectRam.gif?t=1740400150\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Call the banners. Build your army. It's time for a siege.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build out your army with the rewards of your attacks. Choose from archers, swordsman and more to defend your Battering Ram and claim another castle 